I'd use
#ifdef NERF_HEALING_MAXHP_BOOSTS
#define MAX_HEALING_HP_BOOST 0
#define MAX_EXTRA_HEALING_HP_BOOSTS 0
...
#else
#define MAX_HEALING_HP_BOOST 2  /* or whatever */
#define MAX_EXTRA_HEALING_HP_BOOST 5
...
#endif

and then just use:
         heal(HowManyPoints, MAX_HEALING_HP_BOOST);

That seems readable but also maintains Don't Repeat Yourself.



